Audit 88a680a7 #1: one failed GET /api/world/runs/<id> used to end the
"this page updates by itself" view and drop the World order link and the
Check again button. Now any failure except a lost sign-in keeps both, and
every failure except a lost sign-in or an unknown run keeps the 5 s poll.
Audit 88a680a7 #5: deliveries are retried on the next minute's run, so the
wait text says about 1–3 minutes instead of 1–2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 world_wallet_web/world-wallet.js | 11 +++++++----
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

